<title>NEW ZEALAND: Bunge raises offer for Defiance prefs.</title>
<headline>Bunge raises offer for Defiance prefs.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bunge Foods Queensland said on Thursday it had raised its offer for Defiance Foods Ltd preference shares, with attached warrants, to NZ$2.35 from $2.07. Bunge also declared the offer unconditional.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
